 "name": "Maximum: Fog of Exorcism",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/starlight-symphony.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Inari</em></p>\n<p>As an action for 10 cursed energy, you can blast a 60 ft cone with an erupting wave of destructive exploding fog. All creatures within range must make a Constitution saving throw, taking twice your CE modifier XD10 + 6d10 cold damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a success. If a creature is a cursed spirit, the damage ignores any resistance to cold damage and it makes the save at disadvantage. If used at <em>Maximum Output</em>, Cursed spirits automatically fail their saving throw.</p>",
